OL,3,GNEWSACharity festival called off over
OL,4,Alicensing issue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Merseyside charity music festival has
OL,7,Fbeen called off due to an unforeseen
OL,8,Flicensing issue.
OL,10,FMaggie's Fest, an annual music event
OL,11,Fhosted by cancer charity Maggie's
OL,12,FWirral, was due to take place at
OL,13,FBrimstage Farm near Birkenhead on
OL,14,FSaturday.
OL,16,FThe charity will instead host a family
OL,17,Ffun day, with zipwires, tractor rides,
OL,18,Fand a maze, organisers told the Local
OL,19,FDemocracy Reporting Service (LDRS).
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
