OL,4,Alicensing issue
OL,5,
OL,6,FWirral Council said it supported the
OL,7,F"very worthwhile cause" of the charity
OL,8,Fbut there had been an issue with the
OL,9,Ftemporary event notice submitted for
OL,10,Fthe festival.
